                                        "entry_id": "8cfea4fb-5287-3cba-af7d-d6750c54c3db",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To sell (something) at a lower price, or to work for lower wages, than a competitor."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9544d564-66ee-4b43-b10e-ea02bc087439",
                                                "sense_id": "b24a08f5-26bc-394b-843e-ee9e429e4f31",
                                                "text": "The fact that, to cover low tariffs on bulk commodities, the railways have to charge very high rates on high-value goods, such as manufactures, has provided road operators with a golden opportunity to undercut the railway."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a6c07454-80a9-3ef0-be51-7bd7fd4bdaec",
                                        "entry_id": "8cfea4fb-5287-3cba-af7d-d6750c54c3db",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To create an overhang by cutting away material from underneath."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b278b524-f653-3069-ac72-8b8f9b506f60",
                                        "entry_id": "8cfea4fb-5287-3cba-af7d-d6750c54c3db",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To undermine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5dc9d4ae-0058-4751-ace8-041e1fe1c5ff",
                                                "sense_id": "b278b524-f653-3069-ac72-8b8f9b506f60",
                                                "text": "Though Bane’s sing-song voice gives his pronouncements a funny lilt, he doesn’t have any of the Joker’s deranged wit, and Nolan isn’t interested in undercutting his seriousness for the sake of a breezier entertainment."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f5a1a0c3-c635-36c4-adf5-1e442bf525e4",
                                        "entry_id": "8cfea4fb-5287-3cba-af7d-d6750c54c3db",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To strike a heavy blow upward."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d30b76e7-5e89-3282-94a2-8832a4068004",
                                        "entry_id": "8cfea4fb-5287-3cba-af7d-d6750c54c3db",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To employ the undercut strategy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "df58916e-d7e0-378d-aeec-49fc51bc108b",
                                        "entry_id": "8cfea4fb-5287-3cba-af7d-d6750c54c3db",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To downplay or minimize."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7dd52ab2-b226-45e1-a1ac-9d3723dff781",
                                                "sense_id": "df58916e-d7e0-378d-aeec-49fc51bc108b",
                                                "text": "This was a very generous way of describing the swarm of cables, kit-bashed thaumatic cores, Noogenic foci and para-technological inverters, all surrounded by an astoundingly complex cognitohazardous sigil and multiple ontological anchors. This, simultaneously, simplified the interdisciplinary effort that had swelled in a miniscule amount of time, and undercut the sheer conceptual impact this could leave in all of their respective fields."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
